THE RUNGS, AND WHICH NUISANCE EACH ONE ACTUALLY REMOVES
============================================================================================================================
  rung                                           a_0 (m/s^2)    D lever    sin i  Ups lever
  -------------------------------------------- -------------  --------- -------- ----------
  K1 shape-only, all SPARC                         1.392e-10    0 EXACT  0 EXACT     +1.441
  K1 shape-only, gas-dominated                   NO LEVERAGE    0 EXACT  0 EXACT     +0.000
  K3 gas-lever BTFR slope (restatement)            9.790e-11         -2       ~0     +0.000
  K3b point-level gas lever, full kernel           9.397e-11         -2       ~0     +0.000
  K4 flat-curve baryonic-slope law                 1.762e-10    0 EXACT  0 EXACT      large
  K5 f_DM = 1/e landmark                           1.038e-10         -1       -2     -1.512
  item 102 deep tail (normalisation)               9.040e-11       -2.2       -2     -0.650
  canonical footing                                9.360e-11
  alt footing                                      1.130e-10

  THE STRUCTURAL RESULT, which is worth more than any single number above:
  the ONLY distance-free acceleration a galaxy offers is a PHOTOMETRIC one, g_bar = 2 pi G Upsilon Sigma_L,
  because surface brightness and HI surface density are both distance-invariant while every kinematic
  acceleration is V^2/(theta D).  So an estimator is distance-free exactly when it goes through Upsilon,
  and Upsilon-free exactly when it goes through a velocity, hence through D.  The two cancellations are
  MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE for a disc galaxy, and the shape channel does not escape it: shape leverage on a_0
  requires points straddling y ~ 1, which requires stars, which reinstates Upsilon.

